<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - June 16.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - June 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1400 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat to Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth, Gloucester July 113, London, June 110, Beds, Bucks, Northants Oxon June 111,</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk July 84.50, 85, Lincs 85, 85.50 Essex June 84, East Devon June 86</p>
</text>
